   "truncated": false,
   "text": "\r\n\r\nLauren Leadbetter, Anchorage, AK.\nPlease do not put a data center in Cook Inlet. It doesn't offer substantial enough benefits to the community to offset the consequences. Unwanted infrastructure, unnecessary impact on the natural process, no direct benefit for people. NO DATA CENTER.\r\n\r\n"
  }
